{
  "name": "dsh-memory",
  "version": "0.24.35",
  "description": "记忆 —— DSH 跨会话长期记忆插件：自动沉淀用户偏好、项目事实与重要决策，新会话按分类优先与字符预算自动注入；相关度检索（分页＋隐藏态计数＋来源/标签过滤）；写入时相似记忆提示（避免并存矛盾）、同内容归档/过期复活；面板相似记忆查重治理＋注入召回预览＋取代链双向导航＋作用域感知导出＋检索隐藏态提示＋列表注入徽章＋导入合并模式＋来源/标签/状态服务端过滤；「记忆星丛」面板含记忆与设置双标签：统计分布、分类色轨卡片、标签直达、批量选择、删除撤销、导出导入，以及注入/隐私/存储备份/面板偏好设置（settings.json 实时生效、自动备份）；Markdown 一事一文件、手工可编辑，密码/密钥/token 永不写入。Cross-session long-term memory for DeepSeek Harness with a Web management panel.",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/PinBoDHua/dsh-memory.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/PinBoDHua/dsh-memory#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/PinBoDHua/dsh-memory/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2",
    "node": ">=22.6"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "memory",
    "long-term-memory",
    "recall"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller"
      ]
    }
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "lib",
    "client",
    "locale/*.json",
    "docs",
    "scripts",
    "tests",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ]
}
